{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32693","headline":"长安寓居寄柏侍郎 · 李频","name":"长安寓居寄柏侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜轻两鬓欲相侵，愁绪无端不可寻。\n秦女红妆空觅伴，郢郎白雪少知音。\n长亭古木春光老，太华青烟晚更深。\n独向灞陵东北望，一封书寄万重心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}